# 必考词 Unit10
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2025红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 必考词Unit10核心词汇

{{tackle}}{{/ˈtækl}}{{v./n. 处理；对付；阻截；用具}}{{We need to tackle the problem before it gets worse.}}
{{tactic}}{{/ˈtæktɪk}}{{n. 策略；战术；手段；方法}}{{The company changed its marketing tactics.}}
{{talent}}{{/ˈtælənt}}{{n. 才能；天赋；人才；天资}}{{She has a natural talent for painting.}}
{{target}}{{/ˈtɑːɡɪt}}{{n./v. 目标；瞄准；针对；对象}}{{The company targeted young consumers with its new product.}}
{{technique}}{{/tekˈniːk}}{{n. 技术；技巧；方法；技能}}{{The artist uses a unique technique in his paintings.}}
{{technology}}{{/tekˈnɒlədʒi}}{{n. 技术；科技；工艺；工程技术}}{{Technology has transformed our daily lives.}}
{{temper}}{{/ˈtempər}}{{n. 脾气；情绪；韧度；特征；趋向}}{{He lost his temper during the argument.}}
{{temperature}}{{/ˈtemprətʃər}}{{n. 温度；体温；热度；发烧}}{{The temperature dropped below freezing last night.}}
{{temporary}}{{/ˈtemprəri}}{{adj. 暂时的；临时的；短暂的}}{{She found a temporary job for the summer.}}
{{tend}}{{/tend}}{{v. 倾向于；照料；管理；趋向}}{{People tend to eat more in cold weather.}}
{{tendency}}{{/ˈtendənsi}}{{n. 趋势；倾向；癖好；性情}}{{There is a tendency for prices to rise in winter.}}
{{tender}}{{/ˈtendər}}{{adj. 温柔的；嫩的；疼痛的；投标}}{{The meat is very tender and delicious.}}
{{terminal}}{{/ˈtɜːmɪnl}}{{n./adj. 终端；航站楼；晚期的；末端的}}{{Passengers should arrive at the terminal two hours early.}}
{{terminate}}{{/ˈtɜːmɪneɪt}}{{v. 终止；结束；解除；到达终点}}{{The contract was terminated by mutual agreement.}}
{{territory}}{{/ˈterətəri}}{{n. 领土；领域；范围；版图；地盘}}{{The country defended its territory against invasion.}}
{{terror}}{{/ˈterər}}{{n. 恐怖；恐惧；恐怖活动；可怕的人}}{{The attack spread terror throughout the city.}}
{{testify}}{{/ˈtestɪfaɪ}}{{v. 作证；证明；证实；表明}}{{The witness testified in court about what he saw.}}
{{textile}}{{/ˈtekstaɪl}}{{n. 纺织品；纺织业；织物}}{{The textile industry is a major employer in the region.}}
{{theme}}{{/θiːm}}{{n. 主题；题目；主旋律；话题}}{{The theme of the conference is sustainability.}}
{{theory}}{{/ˈθɪəri}}{{n. 理论；学说；原理；推测}}{{The theory was supported by experimental evidence.}}
{{therapy}}{{/ˈθerəpi}}{{n. 治疗；疗法；心理治疗；疗效}}{{Physical therapy helped him recover from the injury.}}
{{thereby}}{{/ˌðeəˈbaɪ}}{{adv. 因此；从而；借以}}{{He resigned, thereby ending his political career.}}
{{thesis}}{{/ˈθiːsɪs}}{{n. 论文；论点；命题；论题}}{{She submitted her doctoral thesis last month.}}
{{thorough}}{{/ˈθʌrə}}{{adj. 彻底的；仔细的；详尽的；完全的}}{{The police conducted a thorough investigation.}}
{{threat}}{{/θret}}{{n. 威胁；恐吓；凶兆；构成威胁的人或物}}{{Climate change is a threat to global food security.}}
{{threshold}}{{/ˈθreʃhəʊld}}{{n. 门槛；入口；开端；极限；阈值}}{{The company is on the threshold of a major breakthrough.}}
{{thrive}}{{/θraɪv}}{{v. 繁荣；茁壮成长；兴旺；旺盛}}{{The business has thrived under new management.}}
{{tide}}{{/taɪd}}{{n. 潮汐；潮流；趋势；浪潮；高涨}}{{The tide comes in twice a day.}}
{{tight}}{{/taɪt}}{{adj./adv. 紧的；紧密的；紧身的；紧紧地}}{{The lid was too tight to open.}}
{{tiny}}{{/ˈtaɪni}}{{adj. 极小的；微小的；很少的}}{{The baby's fingers were tiny and delicate.}}
{{tip}}{{/tɪp}}{{n./v. 尖端；小费；提示；倾斜；指点}}{{She left a generous tip for the waiter.}}
{{title}}{{/ˈtaɪtl}}{{n. 标题；头衔；冠军；所有权；资格}}{{The title of the book is "The Great Gatsby."}}
{{toast}}{{/təʊst}}{{n./v. 烤面包；干杯；祝酒；烤；暖和}}{{They raised their glasses and toasted to success.}}
{{tolerate}}{{/ˈtɒləreɪt}}{{v. 容忍；忍受；容许；有耐药性}}{{I cannot tolerate such rude behavior.}}
{{tone}}{{/təʊn}}{{n. 语气；音调；色调；风格；气氛}}{{She spoke in a calm and reassuring tone.}}
{{topic}}{{/ˈtɒpɪk}}{{n. 话题；主题；题目；论题}}{{The topic of today's lecture is climate change.}}
{{torture}}{{/ˈtɔːtʃər}}{{n./v. 折磨；拷问；痛苦；使苦恼}}{{The prisoners were subjected to torture.}}
{{total}}{{/ˈtəʊtl}}{{adj./n. 总的；全部的；总计；总额；完全的}}{{The total cost of the project is one million dollars.}}
{{tough}}{{/tʌf}}{{adj. 艰难的；坚韧的；强硬的；健壮的；粗暴的}}{{The exam was really tough this year.}}
{{tour}}{{/tʊər}}{{n./v. 旅行；观光；巡回；巡视}}{{They went on a tour of Europe last summer.}}
{{trace}}{{/treɪs}}{{v./n. 追踪；痕迹；微量；描绘；追溯}}{{The police traced the call to a mobile phone.}}
{{track}}{{/træk}}{{n./v. 轨道；追踪；跑道；足迹；小道}}{{The hunter tracked the deer through the forest.}}
{{trade}}{{/treɪd}}{{n./v. 贸易；交易；行业；职业；交换}}{{International trade has increased significantly.}}
{{tradition}}{{/trəˈdɪʃn}}{{n. 传统；惯例；传说；移交；交出}}{{It is a tradition to eat dumplings on New Year's Eve.}}
{{traffic}}{{/ˈtræfɪk}}{{n. 交通；流量；运输；交易；非法买卖}}{{Traffic congestion is a common problem in big cities.}}
{{tragedy}}{{/ˈtrædʒədi}}{{n. 悲剧；灾难；惨事；不幸}}{{The earthquake was a terrible tragedy.}}
{{trail}}{{/treɪl}}{{n./v. 小径；跟踪；拖拽；痕迹；落后}}{{They followed the trail through the forest.}}
{{trait}}{{/treɪt}}{{n. 特征；特点；特性；品质；少许}}{{Honesty is one of her best traits.}}
{{transfer}}{{/trænsˈfɜːr}}{{v./n. 转移；转让；调动；换乘；过户}}{{He transferred to a new department.}}
{{transform}}{{/trænsˈfɔːm}}{{v. 转变；改造；改变；使改观}}{{Technology has transformed the way we live.}}
{{transition}}{{/trænˈzɪʃn}}{{n./v. 过渡；转变；变迁；变革}}{{The country is undergoing a period of political transition.}}
{{translate}}{{/trænsˈleɪt}}{{v. 翻译；转化；理解；解释；调动}}{{She translated the document from Chinese to English.}}
{{transmit}}{{/trænsˈmɪt}}{{v. 传输；传播；发射；传导；遗传}}{{The disease can be transmitted through contaminated water.}}
{{transparent}}{{/trænsˈpærənt}}{{adj. 透明的；明显的；坦率的；易懂的}}{{The company should be more transparent about its finances.}}
{{transport}}{{/trænsˈpɔːt}}{{v./n. 运输；交通；传送；运输工具；强烈情感}}{{The goods were transported by truck.}}
{{trap}}{{/træp}}{{n./v. 陷阱；困住；诱捕；收集；存水弯}}{{The mouse was caught in a trap.}}
{{treasure}}{{/ˈtreʒər}}{{n./v. 财宝；珍爱；珍品；珍藏；重视}}{{The museum displays treasures from ancient Egypt.}}
{{treat}}{{/triːt}}{{v./n. 对待；治疗；请客；处理；款待}}{{The doctor treated the patient with a new drug.}}
{{treaty}}{{/ˈtriːti}}{{n. 条约；协定；协议；协商}}{{The two countries signed a peace treaty.}}
{{tremble}}{{/ˈtrembl}}{{v./n. 颤抖；发抖；战栗；焦虑}}{{She trembled with fear when she heard the noise.}}
{{tremendous}}{{/trɪˈmendəs}}{{adj. 巨大的；极大的；精彩的；可怕的}}{{The project was a tremendous success.}}
{{trend}}{{/trend}}{{n. 趋势；潮流；动向；倾向；时尚}}{{There is a growing trend towards online education.}}
{{trial}}{{/ˈtraɪəl}}{{n. 试验；审判；试用期；考验；预赛}}{{The trial lasted for three weeks.}}
{{tribute}}{{/ˈtrɪbjuːt}}{{n. 贡品；颂词；致敬；悼念；体现}}{{The concert was a tribute to the legendary musician.}}
{{trigger}}{{/ˈtrɪɡər}}{{v./n. 触发；引起；扳机；诱因；引爆器}}{{The crisis triggered a wave of protests.}}
{{triumph}}{{/ˈtraɪʌmf}}{{n./v. 胜利；成功；凯旋；战胜；欢欣}}{{The team's triumph was celebrated by fans worldwide.}}
{{troop}}{{/truːp}}{{n. 军队；一群； troops；部队}}{{The troops were deployed to the border.}}
{{tropical}}{{/ˈtrɒpɪkl}}{{adj. 热带的；酷热的；热情的}}{{The tropical climate is hot and humid all year.}}
{{trust}}{{/trʌst}}{{n./v. 信任；信赖；信托；托拉斯；责任}}{{Trust is the foundation of any good relationship.}}
{{tube}}{{/tjuːb}}{{n. 管；地铁；管状物；电子管；显像管}}{{She squeezed toothpaste from the tube.}}
{{tune}}{{/tjuːn}}{{n./v. 曲调；调音；调整；和谐；频道}}{{The piano is out of tune.}}
{{tunnel}}{{/ˈtʌnl}}{{n. 隧道；地道；洞穴；烟道；风洞}}{{The train passed through a long tunnel.}}
{{turbulent}}{{/ˈtɜːbjələnt}}{{adj. 动荡的；湍流的；混乱的；骚动的}}{{The country went through a turbulent period of reform.}}
{{tutor}}{{/ˈtjuːtər}}{{n./v. 家教；辅导；指导；当家庭教师}}{{She works as a math tutor after school.}}
{{twist}}{{/twɪst}}{{v./n. 扭转；曲折；扭曲；转动；变化}}{{The road twists through the mountains.}}
{{typical}}{{/ˈtɪpɪkl}}{{adj. 典型的；有代表性的；特有的；一贯的}}{{This is a typical example of Chinese architecture.}}
